{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "aea69696ebb290a9aeb5b06e11e1eb5f19306b041dfd38bd4699bbc84ea4c68a", "ja": "おやぶん、ビックリした！？\nビックリしたよね♪　くふふ、大成功だにゃー！", "zh": "老大，吓了一跳吧！？\n确实吓到了吧♪ 嘿嘿，大成功喵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9552e0773cd2c6a2848308d7655f3b9a367b3d4d032166b1fc7df602c14e14a4", "ja": "た、環……。\n現場でかくれんぼは危ないだろう？", "zh": "环……\n在现场玩捉迷藏很危险吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "edc73a353abe7676aee4e5ad79d5ea237d83e3d99de75ddbf4414460612b571d", "ja": "違うよ、おやぶん。\nかくれんぼじゃなくて、こぶんのマネだにゃん！", "zh": "不是哦，老大。\n不是在玩捉迷藏，是在模仿小弟喵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0076ba755a9e05cf08d927cfc9b8a4196537f84c757692d40608eb1ec5a9a97f", "ja": "こぶんの……？", "zh": "小弟的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fe3dfc9d4e41672a43cd652a78a9c8d129557b49198df3c5aff7e1bfb9582cd", "ja": "うん。こぶんがね、よくやるんだ。かげに隠れて、\nじーっと狙って……わぁっ！　って飛び出すの！", "zh": "嗯。小弟经常这么做。躲在阴影里，一动不动地瞄准……哇！一下子扑出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fae65fc9bbd3a908e427e3c0cb149e1609c9ec2434758e9760cea5468c6965b3", "ja": "あっ。劇場で見たことあるな……。\nってことは、環は猫の役作りをしてたのか？", "zh": "啊，我在剧场见过这种场景……  \n这么说来，环是在为猫的角色做准备吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "0e27b298738d3957d76045243e543cb24915f02eb25c54ce02ba38466bb5488c", "ja": "そう！　ねぇねぇ、どうだった！？\nたまき、本物のネコみたいだったでしょ！", "zh": "没错！快说说，怎么样！？\n环演得像真的猫一样，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "f6a667db8b80a61086774e27cd8a3f1d3b46c134e9525f098d3319a6f1c84282", "ja": "こぶんのおかげで、撮影もバッチリだね♪\nネコのたまきを見たら、こぶんもびっくりするぞ～♪", "zh": "多亏了小弟，拍摄也顺利完成啦♪\n看到猫咪环的样子，小弟也会大吃一惊吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0523_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "d22e9721a33fd2290c3d468b4f93aa6e254a06ec2328dc0d832000181d1e8eb3", "ja": "そうだ！　あとで、ごほうびあげなきゃ！\nおいしいネコのおやつ、買って帰ろうっと。くふふ♪", "zh": "对了！待会儿得给小弟奖励才行！\n买点美味的猫咪零食回去吧。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
